  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "As a creator, it is already a struggle to ensure you're uploading the correct avatar to the correct ID. The new SDK squashes the name of the selected avatar and the name of the avatar ID on the same line making it only possible to read the first few words. When you have multiple variations of the same avatar (such as pc and quest!) it becomes very difficult to discern them when all you can see is \"avatar-name-....\" and \"Avatar Name ...\". Please put it back the way it was, it was fine before, there's no reason to scrunch it up like that. If you need more room, the section already has a scroll bar, it scrolls.",
